# Never copy a church's live data into an image.
server/data
logs
*.log

node_modules
dist
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Not needed to build or run the server.
art
deploy
docs
*.md
!README.md

# EXCEPT the user guide: it is compiled into the frontend at build time (see
# vite-plugin-help.ts), so these are a BUILD INPUT, not documentation. Without
# them `npm run build` fails with ENOENT on docs/wiki, and an image that did
# build would ship with its Help drawer empty — on a container install that is
# just as likely to be offline as a booth Mac.
!docs/wiki
